      {
        "text": "In his previous life, Dream Travel, Carefree Travel, Fixed Immortal Travel, and Liquor God Travel were the publicly recognized four great movement Immortal Gu. That recollection sits beside talk of Lady Poison Scorpion using Dream Travel to enter dream realms, not beside a present-timeline holder of Carefree Travel.",
